'''Team Galactic Grunt''' (Japanese: '''ギンガ団のしたっぱ''' ''Team Galactic Underling'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Put 1 random {{TCGP|Glameow}}, {{TCGP|Stunky}}, or {{TCGP|Croagunk}} from your deck into your hand.
}}

