==Trivia==
===Origin===
* {{tc|Team Galactic Grunt}}s are [[grunt]] members of [[Team Galactic]]. Male and female grunts are depicted in this card's illustrations.
* The uncommon print of this card shows two Team Galactic Grunts inside [[Team Galactic HQ]] in [[Veilstone City]].
* The Pokémon affected by this card are the pre-[[Evolution]]s of the main Pokémon of the three Team Galactic {{tc|Commander}}s: [[Mars]], [[Jupiter]], and [[Saturn]].

